{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.meguru.stars.memory",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "星空 · 第一次遇见",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.meguru.stars.memory",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.meguru.stars.memory",
    "idolId": "meguru",
    "startNodeId": "n01",
    "nodes": {
      "n01": {
        "id": "n01",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "我就是在这个公园第一次遇到制作人的，还记得吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "n02"
      },
      "n02": {
        "id": "n02",
        "text": "当然记得。那时候她在打篮球。",
        "nextNodeId": "n03"
      },
      "n03": {
        "id": "n03",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "然后制作人说，自己不是怪人！",
        "nextNodeId": "n04"
      },
      "n04": {
        "id": "n04",
        "text": "……你说过吗？你有点不确定。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05"
      },
      "n05": {
        "id": "n05",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "说过！",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n06": {
        "id": "n06",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "对了，现在的我和相遇的时候比起来怎么样？变帅了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "n07"
      },
      "n07": {
        "id": "n07",
        "text": "你想了想。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "成长得令人惊讶",
            "nextNodeId": "n08a",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "和那时候一样有精神",
            "nextNodeId": "n08b",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "sharedStat",
                "stat": "stress",
                "delta": -4
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "n08a": {
        "id": "n08a",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿，好耶——！",
        "nextNodeId": "n09"
      },
      "n08b": {
        "id": "n08b",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "和那时候一样？……那算是夸我吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "n09"
      },
      "n09": {
        "id": "n09",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "到那天为止，我每天都在期待什么时候能遇到制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "n10"
      },
      "n10": {
        "id": "n10",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "然后在公园看到了穿西装的人……是我的制作人！这个想法一闪而过，我就跑起来了！",
        "nextNodeId": "n11"
      },
      "n11": {
        "id": "n11",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "真的很开心……！我那时候真的很兴奋吧？"
      }
    }
  },
